WEBVTT

00:06.760 --> 00:08.360
Just a little more, Esra!

00:26.920 --> 00:28.560
How interesting…

00:28.560 --> 00:34.340
Never in a thousand years did I imagine a human being born with this kind of power was possible.

00:34.790 --> 00:36.840
It's truly... a miracle.

00:42.030 --> 00:44.850
A child wielding miraculous power.

00:46.780 --> 00:49.720
Esra… you did well hanging in there.

00:52.770 --> 00:54.650
It's a beautiful baby boy.

00:55.600 --> 00:58.780
His name… is Sinbad.

01:04.780 --> 01:07.170
A child who will become king of the seven seas.

01:17.000 --> 01:18.550
Scenery I've never seen before…

01:19.660 --> 01:21.060
Strange beasts…

01:22.110 --> 01:24.370
Humid and warm air...

01:25.060 --> 01:27.810
This is... a Dungeon!

01:31.820 --> 01:34.690
The Conquest of Dungeon Baal <b>・</b> Part 2

01:53.860 --> 01:55.130
Crap!

02:07.540 --> 02:09.150
Don't break formation!

02:10.000 --> 02:11.560
Move forward along the cliff!

02:19.850 --> 02:20.990
What the hell?

02:21.920 --> 02:24.830
A one-hundred-man unit… gone in a flash…

02:32.170 --> 02:35.000
In... In a place like this…

02:35.000 --> 02:36.550
Come at me, beast!

02:52.320 --> 02:53.520
Y-You!

02:56.110 --> 02:57.820
This way!

02:59.110 --> 03:00.110
Hurry up!

03:07.690 --> 03:11.420
But how did you get here before me?

03:12.250 --> 03:14.390
I was the first one to enter.

03:14.390 --> 03:16.630
You're the brat who refused to enlist.

03:16.630 --> 03:17.710
Don't do something you'll regret.

03:18.230 --> 03:19.340
Huh?

03:19.340 --> 03:20.910
I'm a soldier.

03:20.910 --> 03:25.430
There's no reason I should have been saved by an unpatriotic person who defies his own country.

03:25.430 --> 03:28.120
I don't care about your reasons.

03:28.120 --> 03:30.480
I saved your life, so deal with it.

03:30.890 --> 03:35.950
You didn't even bother to thank me.

03:35.950 --> 03:37.150
Look who's childish now.

03:37.860 --> 03:39.570
I’m childish?!

03:40.170 --> 03:44.030
Fine. I’ll explain things in terms that even commoners like you can understand.

03:44.460 --> 03:45.900
Burn it in your head.

03:45.900 --> 03:47.900
My beautiful name.

03:48.680 --> 03:51.260
I am the youngest of the Parthevia Empire's Dragul lineage,

03:51.260 --> 03:55.790
Son of General Draguliel Hendrius Nodomis Pertegomidus,

03:55.790 --> 03:57.970
Lieutenant of the Western Region Military Unit,

03:57.970 --> 04:03.840
Dragul Nol Henrius Govius Menudias Partenuvonomias Dumid Os Kartanon.

04:06.440 --> 04:07.780
Too long.

04:07.780 --> 04:09.060
I’ll shorten it to Drakon.

04:09.550 --> 04:10.680
Huh? What?

04:10.680 --> 04:12.430
I said I’ll just call you Drakon.

04:13.560 --> 04:14.300
That's rude!

04:14.300 --> 04:16.020
There’s no way I’ll remember all that!

04:16.020 --> 04:19.190
I'm just Sinbad, and that's all there is to it!

04:19.190 --> 04:21.070
How dare you mock the Dragul family name!

04:21.780 --> 04:22.440
Die!

04:36.060 --> 04:37.430
Apparently…

04:37.430 --> 04:39.960
It looks like we don't have time to be messing around.

04:46.360 --> 04:47.850
Just look at the size of it.

04:49.540 --> 04:52.520
Is he the Dragon King or something?

04:54.110 --> 04:58.500
He just ate those he didn't like.

04:58.500 --> 05:01.750
Though he's a Dragon King, he resmbles a human King perfectly.

05:01.750 --> 05:04.280
Shut your mouth, you commoner!

05:05.330 --> 05:09.280
To proceed any further, you need to do something about him, huh?

05:10.120 --> 05:13.200
This is where we put our lives on the line.

05:13.200 --> 05:15.790
We're being tested.

05:17.290 --> 05:19.290
Tested, you say?

05:21.770 --> 05:24.140
Sinbad, was it?

05:24.140 --> 05:26.480
I'll make you my subordinate for now.

05:26.480 --> 05:26.800
Huh?

05:27.240 --> 05:30.870
Be my decoy. Distract him.

05:30.870 --> 05:34.010
While you do, I'll head for the door.

05:34.010 --> 05:38.100
This is a test of whether we can achieve our goal despite making sacrifices.

05:38.100 --> 05:40.060
It's a test of determination.

05:40.060 --> 05:41.600
Now, go!

05:41.600 --> 05:43.440
Hey, don't make decisions on your own.

05:44.090 --> 05:47.160
A commoner like you will be helping our country.

05:47.160 --> 05:48.450
Be honored.

05:48.870 --> 05:51.200
If you're killed in action, I'll give you a reward.

05:51.800 --> 05:53.820
Just stop it.

05:53.820 --> 05:56.550
You're really a fool of the military.

05:56.550 --> 06:00.080
How many people have died with that mindset?!

06:06.800 --> 06:08.300
Be brave and stay.

06:08.900 --> 06:11.360
Lay down your life for your country.

06:11.360 --> 06:13.600
That is the pride of the Parthevian army.

06:15.520 --> 06:17.810
Dying for your country means satisfaction.

06:47.280 --> 06:48.880
What troublesome geysers.

06:49.590 --> 06:53.100
I have no idea where they'll erupt next.

06:53.600 --> 06:56.430
And these baby dragons…

07:02.600 --> 07:03.890
The gates…

07:03.890 --> 07:05.360
If I can just open the gates!

07:16.930 --> 07:17.950
I did it!

07:17.950 --> 07:18.950
I made it to the gate!

07:20.240 --> 07:21.620
Now, open!

07:21.620 --> 07:24.380
Oh Gate, open!

07:29.180 --> 07:29.880
Why?

07:30.740 --> 07:32.020
But why?!

07:36.260 --> 07:37.950
These are…

07:47.200 --> 07:50.570
Open. Open, open, open, open!

08:06.500 --> 08:09.000
No… no way, this isn't happening.

08:09.460 --> 08:13.090
I'm definitely going to die.

08:14.430 --> 08:15.650
No, not yet…

08:16.310 --> 08:20.140
I don't want to die yet!

08:28.340 --> 08:33.070
Serendine-sama, First Princess of the Parthevian Empire.

08:33.070 --> 08:37.320
Lieutenant General Barbarossa-sama, eldest of the Dragul Family Line,

08:37.990 --> 08:39.600
Congratulations.

08:39.600 --> 08:45.170
This marriage is the first step towards glory for the Parthevian Empire.

08:46.920 --> 08:50.210
Well said, my brother.

08:51.050 --> 08:52.380
You moron!

08:54.140 --> 08:55.760
Hey, get a hold of yourself.

08:56.370 --> 08:58.350
Get up, or you'll die!

09:07.000 --> 09:08.040
Kill…

09:10.010 --> 09:11.890
...Kill me!

09:12.460 --> 09:15.520
Fearing the enemy while clinging to my position…

09:15.520 --> 09:18.660
I’ve failed as a soldier.

09:18.660 --> 09:20.370
Bullshit.

09:20.860 --> 09:22.660
Be brave and stay.

09:22.660 --> 09:25.340
Give your life for your country?

09:25.340 --> 09:28.380
What's wrong with not wanting to die?

09:29.010 --> 09:30.460
It's so obvious!

09:30.460 --> 09:33.050
You're a human before you're a soldier!

09:34.490 --> 09:36.550
Dying for your country like that…

09:36.550 --> 09:41.200
Have the empire, the army, saved the people at least once?

09:42.760 --> 09:47.940
A country exists to protect the people living in it.

09:47.940 --> 09:51.240
It shouldn't encourage war and pushing them to their deaths.

09:52.140 --> 09:56.120
A country that discards its people… isn't needed!

10:06.130 --> 10:07.480
I’m borrowing this.

10:08.790 --> 10:09.880
Hey, you!

10:11.410 --> 10:14.050
You hear that, Drakon?!

10:16.830 --> 10:20.550
Those with power making sacrifices for their surroundings.

10:20.940 --> 10:22.970
It's the sound of accepting punishment.

12:00.070 --> 12:01.430
It opened.

12:01.430 --> 12:02.850
Let's go.

12:03.510 --> 12:06.600
Just what the hell are you?!

12:08.040 --> 12:12.490
It’s not what I am. It’s who I am.

12:13.180 --> 12:15.880
I'm Sinbad the sailor!

12:26.910 --> 12:28.310
Sinbad…

12:28.870 --> 12:30.900
What a strange man.

12:30.900 --> 12:33.810
When you think he's an idiot who casts away his life,

12:33.810 --> 12:38.060
he's actually calmly analyzing the situation.

12:38.470 --> 12:42.570
He makes the right choices at the right time and place.

12:45.230 --> 12:48.540
A man that rides on the wave of fate.

12:54.670 --> 12:56.110
We're here, huh?

12:56.110 --> 12:58.370
This is the deepest part of the Dungeon.

12:58.370 --> 13:01.150
Is your face turning blue yet?

13:01.150 --> 13:03.660
You're breathing pretty heavily yourself.

13:03.660 --> 13:06.310
Speak for yourself! Don't your feet hurt from running so much?

13:06.310 --> 13:08.640
That's because some idiot put me in a position where I had to!

13:11.300 --> 13:14.730
However, I praise you for doing well, for a commoner.

13:14.730 --> 13:18.940
And I thought you were some spoiled kid, but you've got some backbone.

13:18.940 --> 13:21.230
But not as much as I do, though.

13:21.230 --> 13:23.280
That's my line.

13:27.290 --> 13:29.280
Everything's made of stone.

13:30.060 --> 13:32.740
Nothing seems off, though.

13:32.740 --> 13:36.790
No, it doesn't feel that way to me.

13:52.700 --> 13:54.880
My name is Baal.

13:54.880 --> 13:57.350
I am the Djinn of Wrath and Heroes.

13:58.540 --> 14:01.570
Who is to become king?

14:02.490 --> 14:06.440
Is this what Yunan was talking about? The power to become a king?

14:07.540 --> 14:12.970
The power that the wizards were talking about. If I can present this to his Majesty...

14:12.970 --> 14:13.700
In that case…

14:14.770 --> 14:16.600
The one who'll become king…

14:16.600 --> 14:18.330
Is me!

14:20.470 --> 14:22.550
Don't interfere, Drakon.

14:22.550 --> 14:26.810
I'm here with official orders from the Imperial Royalty.

14:26.810 --> 14:27.340
Stand down.

14:27.890 --> 14:29.590
To hell with your official order.

14:30.080 --> 14:34.720
I won't give any more power to those who step over the innocent.

14:35.410 --> 14:36.600
I've decided.

14:37.250 --> 14:42.110
I'll change this country – no, this world – with my own hands!

14:43.740 --> 14:47.150
So in the end, we have to settle the score.

14:47.600 --> 14:50.290
I owe you for saving my life.

14:50.290 --> 14:53.910
But I'm still a Parthevian soldier.

14:54.320 --> 14:57.410
And I won't waver either.

14:58.870 --> 15:04.170
Let us see who shall become my master.

15:08.600 --> 15:09.900
You're pretty good.

15:09.900 --> 15:10.470
But still…!

15:16.330 --> 15:19.390
Sinbad, you may be strong, but

15:22.050 --> 15:24.480
I'm not weak either!

15:29.840 --> 15:30.860
Goodbye.

15:38.670 --> 15:41.790
It's true you're a better swordsman.

15:42.090 --> 15:46.540
But this isn't a battle of who's better with a sword!

15:51.380 --> 15:54.430
I'm losing consciousness…

15:57.000 --> 16:00.390
I promise that this conquest for the Dungeon will be a success.

16:00.920 --> 16:04.740
I absolutely will not hurt Serendine-sama's name.

16:10.120 --> 16:11.610
Don't be so serious.

16:11.610 --> 16:13.030
Your forehead will get wrinkles.

16:13.640 --> 16:17.940
Besides, I'm known as the Venomous Spider Princess.

16:17.940 --> 16:20.040
What's there to hurt?

16:20.850 --> 16:23.770
I've taken a liking to having two names.

16:23.770 --> 16:24.790
Shoot a web.

16:24.790 --> 16:27.510
Weaken the opponent, and kill them.

16:27.510 --> 16:32.050
I'm exactly like a spider that never lets her prey get away.

16:33.560 --> 16:37.930
So in your case, I'm more tenacious than you think.

16:37.930 --> 16:39.560
That's why, Dragul…

16:40.830 --> 16:42.060
Dying is unforgivable.

16:47.270 --> 16:49.960
I can't lose yet…

16:49.960 --> 16:52.400
I haven't lost yet!

16:56.290 --> 16:57.610
I can…

16:58.520 --> 17:00.120
I can still keep going!

17:06.100 --> 17:07.480
Brother.

17:07.480 --> 17:11.560
Serendine-sama is a beautiful, smart, and strong princess.

17:11.560 --> 17:15.970
I'm sure you got to know her plenty yesterday.

17:16.400 --> 17:18.270
I support you both from the bottom of my hea---

17:18.270 --> 17:22.970
Junior. Aren't you misunderstanding something?

17:23.480 --> 17:26.550
This engagement is just like a foolish festival.

17:26.550 --> 17:33.130
It's just so the Dragul family can rebuild this weakening country.

17:33.130 --> 17:34.990
So about the princess…

17:35.370 --> 17:36.990
I don't love her.

17:39.210 --> 17:40.930
I couldn't say anything.

17:40.930 --> 17:42.880
I couldn't do anything.

17:42.880 --> 17:45.440
I couldn't protect the princess,

17:45.440 --> 17:49.500
nor could I tell her my feelings, either.

17:50.620 --> 17:52.130
It's frustrating.

17:57.960 --> 18:01.890
My own… My own weakness is frustrating.

18:02.590 --> 18:07.390
But even so, I have things to protect.

18:08.740 --> 18:10.130
I know.

18:10.130 --> 18:14.400
I have my own reasons for not losing, either.

18:16.060 --> 18:16.900
That's why…

18:23.880 --> 18:24.580
I…

18:25.080 --> 18:25.660
I…

18:35.300 --> 18:37.090
...can't lose!

18:46.230 --> 18:48.850
I win.

18:52.540 --> 18:54.860
I've bared witness.

18:54.860 --> 18:57.320
I now acknowledge you as my master.

18:57.990 --> 18:59.150
Receive this!

19:00.990 --> 19:05.030
This is the power that many have desired.

19:08.870 --> 19:11.120
The First Dungeon Baal

19:11.210 --> 19:14.290
Conquest Completed

19:18.970 --> 19:20.320
It's a soldier.

19:20.320 --> 19:22.320
An unconscious soldier!

19:33.850 --> 19:37.480
Great job, young conqueror.

19:37.790 --> 19:39.900
You're now honored as a young soldier.

19:39.900 --> 19:41.580
You've done well.

19:41.580 --> 19:45.760
Now, please hand over the loot and the Dungeon's power.

19:45.760 --> 19:47.990
Don't lump me in with you lot.

19:48.480 --> 19:51.310
This power and treasure is something that I worked for.

19:51.310 --> 19:53.290
I'll never hand them over to you.

19:53.570 --> 19:55.080
What did you say?!

19:55.080 --> 19:56.880
He's rebelling against the empire!

19:56.880 --> 19:57.550
Get him!

20:01.720 --> 20:05.010
Aren't you going to use the power you just earned?

20:05.010 --> 20:06.270
Yunan!

20:06.270 --> 20:07.970
Oh, that's right.

20:07.970 --> 20:11.730
You don't know how to use those powers yet.

20:13.810 --> 20:17.690
Do you need my assistance already, master?

20:18.160 --> 20:19.240
A blue giant!

20:19.240 --> 20:21.620
What is that? A monster?!

20:21.620 --> 20:24.890
Now, follow what your heart is telling you.

20:26.290 --> 20:28.690
O spirit of wrath and heroes.

20:28.690 --> 20:31.350
I command you to slay a thousand-fold.

20:31.350 --> 20:36.080
Use my magoi and will to enhance your power.

20:37.240 --> 20:39.590
Come forth, Baal!

20:46.160 --> 20:48.390
This is… my power?!

20:48.390 --> 20:49.980
Sinbad.

20:53.050 --> 20:54.140
Yunan? What's going on?!

20:54.520 --> 20:57.040
It'll take two days by boat, right?

20:57.040 --> 20:58.650
This a service of goodwill from me.

21:15.310 --> 21:17.700
That was the first time I've ever flown.

21:17.700 --> 21:19.500
Sin-nii-chan?

21:20.120 --> 21:21.880
It really is Sin-nii-chan!

21:21.880 --> 21:23.600
I'm back, everyone.

21:23.600 --> 21:25.010
Where have you been?!

21:25.390 --> 21:26.140
I conquered a Dun—

21:26.140 --> 21:29.220
Where were you for two months, leaving Esra-san alone?!

21:46.760 --> 21:50.870
Dear… is that you?

21:50.870 --> 21:52.060
You're back.

21:53.900 --> 21:56.240
If I can see you,

21:56.240 --> 21:58.740
It means I must be going soon.

21:59.440 --> 22:03.050
You know, in that brief moment,

22:03.050 --> 22:07.550
when he took your sword and went on his adventure...

22:08.860 --> 22:13.060
He was happy, confident, and overdoing it like a fool.

22:14.410 --> 22:18.270
But he treasures his family and friends.

22:18.270 --> 22:23.550
He really is a kind child, just like you.

22:23.550 --> 22:26.070
But he's grown up now.

22:27.310 --> 22:29.950
I'm sure he's okay.

22:31.690 --> 22:34.200
I love you… Sin…

22:35.560 --> 22:37.460
You've found it, haven't you?

22:37.910 --> 22:39.830
Something that only you can do.

22:40.770 --> 22:45.090
Go and do what you have to do.

22:45.390 --> 22:47.720
I'll be fine.

24:32.820 --> 24:38.950
Since then, Sinbad's name spread far and wide throughout Parthevia.

24:39.500 --> 24:43.040
And when news of how the Dungeon that was challenged by over 10,000 men

24:43.040 --> 24:46.940
was conquered by a 14-year-old boy,

24:46.940 --> 24:50.960
the war-torn started to feel encouragement.

24:51.900 --> 25:01.360
On the other hand, the little commoner hero was seen as an eyesore to royalty.

25:08.990 --> 25:13.990
They couldn't allow him to do as he pleased.

25:14.360 --> 25:16.990
A plan to capture him was set up.

25:17.260 --> 25:18.290
Listen.

25:18.290 --> 25:22.130
Sinbad will surely take his leave from this point.

25:22.130 --> 25:24.000
Be sure to arrest him and bring him here.

25:24.330 --> 25:25.080
Yes ma'am!

25:25.080 --> 25:27.530
For the princess to have to come here herself…

25:27.530 --> 25:28.960
How deplorable.

25:28.960 --> 25:30.370
Don't say that.

25:30.370 --> 25:32.600
We don't have enough troops to send out right now.

25:32.600 --> 25:35.240
It's just me and my guards.

25:35.240 --> 25:36.760
Besides…

25:36.770 --> 25:39.600
We won't do your bidding anymore!

25:39.600 --> 25:42.820
Sinbad sold his treasures and bought a boat!

25:42.820 --> 25:47.120
Who would ever follow an incompetent idiot who's interested in nothing but war?!

25:47.120 --> 25:48.700
Go home, you dogs!

25:48.700 --> 25:49.680
Move!

25:56.520 --> 25:59.150
I won't allow you to insult my father.

25:59.150 --> 26:02.490
I'll cut off your tongue and set you on fire!

26:03.780 --> 26:04.410
Stop.

26:05.340 --> 26:06.410
That young boy…

26:07.060 --> 26:09.420
You're Sinbad, aren't you?

26:10.010 --> 26:14.130
Oh? I'm glad a pretty lady like you knows my name.

26:14.130 --> 26:17.430
How dare you! Don't you know who she is?

26:17.430 --> 26:22.930
This is Serendine-sama, First Princess of the Parthevian Empire!

26:23.300 --> 26:26.180
Parthevia's Venomous Spider Princess?!

26:26.540 --> 26:31.690
Let me show you what happens to people that treat me like a pampered lady.

26:32.060 --> 26:35.280
Unfortunately, I don't like hurting girls—

26:35.280 --> 26:36.570
Stop spouting off!

26:37.530 --> 26:39.570
You fight well for someone with a pretty face.

26:40.070 --> 26:42.410
But you can't beat me.

26:47.090 --> 26:51.920
Do you know why people call me the Venomous Spider Princess?

26:51.920 --> 26:55.850
I'm aware that people from other lands call me that.

26:55.850 --> 26:57.470
That being said…

27:00.030 --> 27:03.470
That's poison from Desert king spiders.

27:04.600 --> 27:06.140
What's so funny?

27:06.140 --> 27:08.980
Good thing I took this on the fly.

27:08.980 --> 27:11.150
That's the antidote!

27:13.290 --> 27:17.690
Don't tell me… he took it from my pocket back then?

27:20.740 --> 27:22.950
And with that, I'm taking her hostage.

27:22.950 --> 27:23.530
Stop it!

27:23.530 --> 27:26.110
Don't interfere until I get on my boat.

27:26.110 --> 27:27.900
Princess!

27:29.700 --> 27:31.960
Damn you, put me down!

27:33.020 --> 27:33.960
What are you doing?!

27:34.380 --> 27:37.710
How dare you put me through this kind of embarrassment!

27:38.380 --> 27:42.930
S-Stay back. Don't touch me!

27:44.210 --> 27:45.350
Stop!

27:50.210 --> 27:53.260
Your soldiers can fetch you from this distance, right?

27:53.260 --> 27:57.320
Thanks for letting me take you hostage, pretty lady.

27:58.690 --> 28:03.860
Never... I'll never forgive you, Sinbad!

28:05.850 --> 28:07.990
Let's go.

28:09.010 --> 28:10.830
I'm going to change the world!
